  "description": "YITAMOTOR black quad headlights for 2009-2018 Dodge Ram. In addition to keeping you safe at night, the headlights’ stylish design keeps you looking good on the road!\nFitment\n2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500\n2010-2018 Dodge Ram 2500/3500\n(Not fit 2010-up Ram with factory projector LED style headlights)\n(Fit both Quad and Dual style factory halogen headlight models)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nCompatibility: the headlight assemblies are compatible with 2009 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 Dodge Ram 1500 / 2010-2018 Dodge Ram 2500 3500(Only fit stock quad style halogen headlights; Don't fit: 2010-2018 Dodge Ram models with stock projector LED-style headlights); (Only for Quad Models); High beam bulbs type: 9005; low beam bulbs type: 9006; turn signal bulbs type: 3157A/4157A(halogen bulbs and wiring harness are not included)\nVALUE & DURABILITY - AUTOSAVER88's strict quality measures ensure products' reliability. Strict testing throughout production ensures our headlights perform well enough in any conditions\nSEALED DESIGN - Waterproof construction ensures that our headlights are completely sealed to prevent outside moisture and work well in any bad weather, such as rain, snow, sand, etc\nSAFE & DURABLE - Micro-prism reflector alerts oncoming cars to notice you at night and the chrome-plated finish inside headlights greatly increases the reflectivity of light to make illumination brighter and ultra-wide lighting angle. One-way vents help drive away the accumulated moisture to keep headlights in good condition for longer lifespan\nDIRECT FIT - Pair of headlights with both left (driver side) & right (passenger side); identical to original housings, which ensures no gaps after installation. Professional installation would be highly recommended",
